  "description": "Reid e20 | 20\" Compact Commuter eBike\nCompact by design. Ready for everyday life.\n\nThe commuter and urban riders transit companion. The compact frame design, small wheel and light cargo capacity makes blasting from A to B and city living easy and fun. Been to the office but need to pick up some shopping on the way home? The e20 has your back.The e20 has been designed to give the best of both worlds - a compact 20\" wheel e bike that is ideal for city living or whenever efficient storage is a must while also providing a practical cargo solution on 2 wheels. A rear rack that will accept pannier bags and a large open top front basket give storage flexibility whether its a work backpack, quick trip to shops or a BBQ for the beach on a summer evening. The e20 is part of a growing category of compact and practical e bikes that are a blast to ride without sacrificing on practicality.\n\nWho is the e20 for?\n\nThe e20 is ideal for:\n\nCity commuting and everyday travel\n\nHow far can the e20 travel on full charge?\nThe e20 can deliver up to approximately 80km of range on a full charge under ideal conditions. Actual range will vary depending on rider weight, luggage, terrain, wind, tyre pressure, temperature and the level of electric assistance used.\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
